# Cloudflare Workers static-asset redirects.
# Copied to the root of the asset directory by `docs/script/prepare-cf-assets.js`.
#
# The documentation is built under `/docs/hyperformula/`, so the asset root
# itself holds no document. Send it to the documentation entry point instead of
# a 404 - this makes preview URLs
# (`https://<branch>-hyperformula-docs.<subdomain>.workers.dev`) usable without
# manually appending the path.
#
# The documentation's former addresses (`/docs/*` outside the new base) are
# redirected by `worker/index.js`, not here: a `/docs/*` rule in this file
# would also match `/docs/hyperformula/*`, and redirects here apply even when
# an asset matches.
/ /docs/hyperformula/ 302

# The sitemap is split into `sitemap-index.xml` and its parts; keep the former
# single-file address working for search consoles and robots.txt.
/docs/hyperformula/sitemap.xml /docs/hyperformula/sitemap-index.xml 301

# The API reference overview is built as `api.html`. Its former file name
# (which `worker/index.js` also requests for `/api/`), and the TypeDoc readme
# input that used to be published as a page of its own, lead there.
/docs/hyperformula/api/index.html /docs/hyperformula/api.html 301
/docs/hyperformula/api-ref-readme.html /docs/hyperformula/api.html 301
/docs/hyperformula/api-ref-readme.md /docs/hyperformula/api/index.md 301
